  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You’re capable of using your lay on hands ability faster than normal.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Lay on hands class feature, Wis 13, Cha 13, Extra Lay on Hands, paladin level 6th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can sacrifice 2d6 healing from your lay on hands ability to use it as a move action instead of a standard action. You only gain this benefit when using lay on hands to heal an ally; damaging an undead creature still requires a standard action. In addition, the paladin may still heal himself as a swift action.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Paladin and Justicar levels stack for qualifying for this feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-justicar#toc29\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
